<!DOCTYPE html><!--h09FqTpTWgXJ1NrcuXSUR--><html lang="en" class="__variable_eb6a5a __variable_67a390 __variable_a74ce6"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/313510e2713fb214-s.p.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/558ca1a6aa3cb55e-s.p.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/e6099e249fd938cc-s.p.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/logo-192.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/proof/0xmarionawfal.jpg"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/proof/milesdeutscher.jpg"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/da8ba54823a77372.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-ad343bbdc5496a17.js"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/ba3e1a7a-e96069ecd9180ad3.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/557-f26af5cdc2cdc01e.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-fefc30ea2a1d3a94.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/909-8c697c20fd8243aa.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-bc320b1a8d99bb25.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/page-fcb398b3972dcb96.js" async=""></script><link rel="preload" href="https://talivia.com/script.js" as="script"/><meta name="next-size-adjust" content=""/><title>AgenKit: AI Engineering Team for Claude, Cursor, Codex</title><meta name="description" content="A full team of specialist AI coding agents and the /agenkit workflow for Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, and four more harnesses. Local memory cuts token usage."/><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"/><meta name="keywords" content="AI engineering team,AI coding agents,agentic coding,memory agents,context agents,Claude Code agents,Cursor AI agents,Codex agents,AI coding workflow,local codebase memory"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#0c0f14"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://agenkit.xyz"/><meta property="og:title" content="AgenKit: AI Engineering Team for Claude, Cursor, Codex"/><meta property="og:description" content="AgenKit is a guided AI engineering team: specialist agents, skills, and the /agenkit command, installed into Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, OpenCode, Antigravity, GitHub Copilot, or Kimi Code in one command, and driven from idea to shipped. One yearly subscription that pays for every update the kit gets."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://agenkit.xyz"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="AgenKit"/><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://agenkit.xyz/opengraph-image?96c25dea1935a8e1"/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="AgenKit: AI Engineering Team for Claude, Cursor, Codex"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="AgenKit is a guided AI engineering team: specialist agents, skills, and the /agenkit command, installed into Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, OpenCode, Antigravity, GitHub Copilot, or Kimi Code in one command, and driven from idea to shipped. One yearly subscription that pays for every update the kit gets."/><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="AgenKit"/><meta name="twitter:image:type" content="image/png"/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://agenkit.xyz/opengraph-image?96c25dea1935a8e1"/><meta name="twitter:image:width" content="1200"/><meta name="twitter:image:height" content="630"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon-32.png" sizes="32x32" type="image/png"/><link rel="icon" href="/logo-192.png" sizes="192x192" type="image/png"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" sizes="180x180" type="image/png"/><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('agenkit-theme');if(t==='light'||t==='dark'){document.documentElement.dataset.theme=t;}}catch(e){}})();</script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://agenkit.xyz/#organization","name":"AgenKit","alternateName":["AgenKit AI engineering team","AgenKit Engineering Kit"],"url":"https://agenkit.xyz","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://agenkit.xyz/logo-192.png","width":192,"height":192},"description":"AgenKit is a guided AI engineering team: specialist agents, skills, and the /agenkit command, installed into Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, OpenCode, Antigravity, GitHub Copilot, or Kimi Code in one command, and driven from idea to shipped. One yearly subscription that pays for every update the kit gets.","sameAs":["https://t.me/agenkit"]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://agenkit.xyz/#website","url":"https://agenkit.xyz","name":"AgenKit","description":"AgenKit is a guided AI engineering team: specialist agents, skills, and the /agenkit command, installed into Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, OpenCode, Antigravity, GitHub Copilot, or Kimi Code in one command, and driven from idea to shipped. One yearly subscription that pays for every update the kit gets.","publisher":{"@id":"https://agenkit.xyz/#organization"}}]}</script><div class="frame" aria-hidden="true"></div><header class="nav"><div class="nav-inner"><a class="brand" aria-label="AgenKit home" data-talivia-event="logo-click" href="/"><img src="/logo-192.png" alt="" width="30" height="30" class="brand-logo"/><span class="brand-mark">AgenKit<span class="brand-tag">kits</span></span></a><nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Primary"><a class="nav-link" data-talivia-event="nav-link-click" data-talivia-event-label="What&#x27;s inside" href="/#whats-inside">What&#x27;s inside</a><a class="nav-link" data-talivia-event="nav-link-click" data-talivia-event-label="Kit" href="/kits/engineering-kit">Kit</a><a class="nav-link" data-talivia-event="nav-link-click" data-talivia-event-label="Guides" href="/guides">Guides</a><a class="nav-link" data-talivia-event="nav-link-click" data-talivia-event-label="Agents" href="/agents">Agents</a><a class="nav-link" data-talivia-event="nav-link-click" data-talivia-event-label="Docs" href="/docs">Docs</a><a class="nav-link" data-talivia-event="nav-link-click" data-talivia-event-label="Pricing" href="/pricing">Pricing</a><a class="nav-link" data-talivia-event="nav-link-click" data-talivia-event-label="FAQ" href="/#faq">FAQ</a><a class="nav-link" data-talivia-event="nav-link-click" data-talivia-event-label="Activate" href="/activate">Activate</a><button type="button" class="theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle theme" title="Toggle theme"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.8 9.8Z"></path></svg></button><a class="btn btn-dark" href="https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_TvD3KmiP1XyKdrP13r0Q5cX96Qr2Zb09CoTdm3zrQLG?utm_source=site&amp;utm_medium=cta&amp;utm_content=nav" data-talivia-event="buy-subscription-click" data-talivia-event-price="39" data-talivia-event-location="nav">Get AgenKit <span class="ar">↗</span></a></nav><div class="nav-actions" style="margin-left:auto" data-mobile="true"><button type="button" class="theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle theme" title="Toggle theme"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.8 9.8Z"></path></svg></button><button type="button" class="nav-burger" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false">≡</button></div></div></header><main id="main"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"SoftwareApplication","name":"AgenKit","applicationCategory":"DeveloperApplication","operatingSystem":"Windows, macOS, Linux","url":"https://agenkit.xyz","description":"AgenKit is a guided AI engineering team: specialist agents, skills, and the /agenkit command, installed into Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, OpenCode, Antigravity, GitHub Copilot, or Kimi Code in one command, and driven from idea to shipped. One yearly subscription that pays for every update the kit gets.","offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":"39","priceCurrency":"USD","url":"https://agenkit.xyz/pricing","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://agenkit.xyz/#organization"}},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Which tools does it work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"All seven: Claude Code, Cursor, Codex CLI, OpenCode, Antigravity CLI, GitHub Copilot, and Kimi Code. The kit is compiled to the exact file layout each tool expects."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I start it in my tool?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Trigger AgenKit with /agenkit in most tools (Claude Code, Cursor, OpenCode, Antigravity, and Kimi Code). In GitHub Copilot it's @agenkit, and in Codex you invoke the AgenKit skill by name. The install step prints the exact trigger for your harness."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What exactly do I get?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Engineering Kit - a full team of specialist agents, the process skills that guide them, and the /agenkit command - delivered as versioned archives installed by the agenkit CLI. Your license key is the only credential; there is no account to manage."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need to create an account?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Checkout issues a license key via Polar; the CLI stores it locally and the API validates it on install."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it one-time or a subscription?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A simple subscription that works out to just $3.49/mo (billed yearly). Early subscribers keep that founding rate while subscribed; after that it's $15/mo. It covers every update while active, across all seven harnesses. Cancel any time; the installed kit keeps working locally."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do updates work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Run agenkit update. It compares your lockfile to the latest versions and refreshes everything your subscription unlocks."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a refund policy?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes - a 14-day money-back window, handled through Polar's customer portal."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is AgenKit related to OpenAI's AgentKit?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. AgenKit (agenkit.xyz) is an independent product: a guided engineering team you install into Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, and other harnesses. It is not affiliated with OpenAI AgentKit."}}]}]}</script><section class="container hero" data-talivia-visible="hero-seen"><div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div><svg class="hero-backdrop" viewBox="0 0 820 380" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice"><g class="hb-lines" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1"><line x1="80" y1="120" x2="220" y2="60" style="animation-delay:0s"></line><line x1="220" y1="60" x2="360" y2="150" style="animation-delay:0.18s"></line><line x1="360" y1="150" x2="520" y2="90" style="animation-delay:0.36s"></line><line x1="520" y1="90" x2="640" y2="180" style="animation-delay:0.54s"></line><line x1="640" y1="180" x2="760" y2="100" style="animation-delay:0.72s"></line><line x1="80" y1="120" x2="180" y2="260" style="animation-delay:0.8999999999999999s"></line><line x1="180" y1="260" x2="420" y2="300" style="animation-delay:1.08s"></line><line x1="360" y1="150" x2="420" y2="300" style="animation-delay:1.26s"></line><line x1="420" y1="300" x2="600" y2="320" style="animation-delay:1.44s"></line><line x1="600" y1="320" x2="740" y2="260" style="animation-delay:1.6199999999999999s"></line><line x1="640" y1="180" x2="600" y2="320" style="animation-delay:1.7999999999999998s"></line><line x1="760" y1="100" x2="740" y2="260" style="animation-delay:1.98s"></line></g><g class="hb-nodes" fill="var(--color-accent)"><circle cx="80" cy="120" r="3" style="animation-delay:0s"></circle><circle cx="220" cy="60" r="3" style="animation-delay:0.22s"></circle><circle cx="360" cy="150" r="3" style="animation-delay:0.44s"></circle><circle cx="520" cy="90" r="3" style="animation-delay:0.66s"></circle><circle cx="640" cy="180" r="3" style="animation-delay:0.88s"></circle><circle cx="760" cy="100" r="3" style="animation-delay:1.1s"></circle><circle cx="180" cy="260" r="3" style="animation-delay:1.32s"></circle><circle cx="420" cy="300" r="3" style="animation-delay:1.54s"></circle><circle cx="600" cy="320" r="3" style="animation-delay:1.76s"></circle><circle cx="740" cy="260" r="3" style="animation-delay:1.98s"></circle></g></svg><div class="hero-grid"><div class="reveal"><a class="hero-flash" data-talivia-event="ship-banner-click" data-talivia-event-location="home" href="/docs"><span class="ship-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="hero-flash-view"><span class="hero-flash-track"><span class="hero-flash-copy"><b>New update:</b> Local Memory. Fewer tokens, faster sessions. <span class="hero-flash-cta">Read the docs →</span></span><span class="hero-flash-copy hero-flash-dup" aria-hidden="true"><b>New update:</b> Local Memory. Fewer tokens, faster sessions. <span class="hero-flash-cta">Read the docs →</span></span></span></span></a><div class="hero-chips"><span class="chip-pill"><b>Engineering Kit</b> · driven by /agenkit</span><span class="chip-pill"><b>New</b> Local memory</span></div><h1 style="margin-top:var(--space-lg)">Ship <span class="accent">production software</span>, solo.</h1><p class="lede" style="margin-top:var(--space-lg)">Run <code>/agenkit</code>, describe what you&#x27;re building, and a full team of specialist agents takes it from brainstorm to architecture, test-first build, review, and ship, pausing for your approval at each step. Production-quality thinking, without hiring the team.</p><div class="hero-cta"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_TvD3KmiP1XyKdrP13r0Q5cX96Qr2Zb09CoTdm3zrQLG?utm_source=site&amp;utm_medium=cta&amp;utm_content=home-hero" data-talivia-event="hero-cta-primary" data-talivia-event-price="39" data-talivia-event-location="hero">Subscribe · $<!-- -->3.49<!-- -->/mo <span class="ar">↗</span></a><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" data-talivia-event="hero-cta-secondary" href="#how">See how it works</a></div><div class="hero-mentions"><p class="hero-mentions-kicker">Trusted by Industry AI Leaders</p><a href="https://x.com/RoundtableSpace/status/2109966127111540755" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hero-mention" data-talivia-visible="nawfal-hero-seen" data-talivia-event="nawfal-tweet-click" data-talivia-event-location="hero" data-talivia-event-target="hero"><img src="/proof/0xmarionawfal.jpg" alt="" width="44" height="44" class="hero-mention-avatar"/><span class="hero-mention-copy"><span class="hero-mention-title">Mario Nawfal</span><span class="hero-mention-sub">Posted to 267K · the AgenKit workflow</span></span><span class="hero-mention-cta">View tweet <span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a><a href="https://x.com/milesdeutscher/status/2104742239037726973" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hero-mention" data-talivia-visible="deutscher-hero-seen" data-talivia-event="deutscher-tweet-click" data-talivia-event-location="hero" data-talivia-event-target="hero"><img src="/proof/milesdeutscher.jpg" alt="" width="44" height="44" class="hero-mention-avatar"/><span class="hero-mention-copy"><span class="hero-mention-title">Miles Deutscher</span><span class="hero-mention-sub">Posted to 681K · install the kit</span></span><span class="hero-mention-cta">View tweet <span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a></div><p class="hero-fine">One kit · seven harnesses · one license key</p><p class="hero-tagline">Your $20 AI plan dies in two projects.<!-- --> <span class="accent">AgenKit makes it last.</span></p></div><div class="reveal"><figure class="flow" aria-label="How the /agenkit workflow turns a task into shipped software" data-talivia-visible="workflow-seen"><div class="flow-intro"><p class="flow-scope">Build any software, at any scale - solo.</p><a class="flow-context" href="#harnesses" data-talivia-event="harnesses-link-click" data-talivia-event-location="workflow">In Claude Code · Cursor · Codex · +4 more →</a></div><div class="flow-prompt"><span class="flow-line flow-line-ghost" aria-hidden="true"><span class="flow-caret">/agenkit</span> <!-- -->build a production-grade Polymarket bot with a Markov-chain signal</span><span class="flow-line flow-line-live"><span class="flow-caret">/agenkit</span> <span class="flow-cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></div><ol class="flow-steps"><li class="flow-step is-active"><span class="flow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="flow-body"><div class="flow-head"><b>Orient</b><span class="flow-who">Context Engineer</span></div><div class="flow-note">no memory yet, indexing your codebase<span class="flow-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div></div><span class="flow-tick" aria-hidden="true"></span></li><li class="flow-step is-pending"><span class="flow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="flow-body"><div class="flow-head"><b>Brainstorm</b><span class="flow-who">Conductor</span></div><div class="flow-note">turns your idea into a clear spec</div></div><span class="flow-tick" aria-hidden="true"></span></li><li class="flow-step is-pending"><span class="flow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="flow-body"><div class="flow-head"><b>Architecture</b><span class="flow-who">Backend Architect</span></div><div class="flow-note">services · data model · idempotency</div></div><span class="flow-tick" aria-hidden="true"></span></li><li class="flow-step is-pending"><span class="flow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="flow-body"><div class="flow-head"><b>Build · test-first</b><span class="flow-who">Test Engineer</span></div><div class="flow-note">failing test → green → refactor</div></div><span class="flow-tick" aria-hidden="true"></span></li><li class="flow-step is-pending"><span class="flow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="flow-body"><div class="flow-head"><b>Review</b><span class="flow-who">Code Reviewer</span></div><div class="flow-note">spec ✓ then code quality ✓</div></div><span class="flow-tick" aria-hidden="true"></span></li><li class="flow-step is-pending"><span class="flow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="flow-body"><div class="flow-head"><b>Ship</b><span class="flow-who">Infra / DevOps</span></div><div class="flow-note">CI/CD · deploy · verify</div></div><span class="flow-tick" aria-hidden="true"></span></li></ol><figcaption class="flow-ship ">Running the pipeline…</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><div class="container"><div class="assurance-bar" data-talivia-visible="assurance-seen"><div class="assurance-item"><span class="assurance-ic" aria-hidden="true">◆</span><b class="assurance-title">Built by FAANG &amp; frontier-AI engineers</b><p class="assurance-body">Eleven focused agents and process skills encode production concerns: tests, security, architecture, and observability, coordinated by /agenkit.</p></div><div class="assurance-item"><span class="assurance-ic" aria-hidden="true">⟳</span><b class="assurance-title">Updated continuously</b><p class="assurance-body">The workflows keep improving. Pull the latest anytime with one command,<!-- --> <code>agenkit update</code>, included while you&#x27;re subscribed.</p></div><div class="assurance-item"><span class="assurance-ic" aria-hidden="true">◷</span><b class="assurance-title">One simple yearly plan</b><p class="assurance-body">A single yearly subscription covers every update. Cancel anytime; your installed kit keeps working locally.</p></div></div><div class="harness-logos" data-talivia-visible="harness-logos-seen"><p class="harness-logos-label">One kit, seven harnesses, the same team everywhere</p><ul class="harness-logo-row"><li><a class="harness-logo" data-talivia-event="harness-logo-click" data-talivia-event-label="Claude Code" href="/for/claude-code"><img src="/harness/claude-code.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"/><span>Claude Code</span></a></li><li><a class="harness-logo" data-talivia-event="harness-logo-click" data-talivia-event-label="Cursor" href="/for/cursor"><img src="/harness/cursor.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"/><span>Cursor</span></a></li><li><a class="harness-logo" data-talivia-event="harness-logo-click" data-talivia-event-label="Codex" href="/for/codex"><img src="/harness/codex.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"/><span>Codex</span></a></li><li><a class="harness-logo" data-talivia-event="harness-logo-click" data-talivia-event-label="OpenCode" href="/for/opencode"><img src="/harness/opencode.svg" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"/><span>OpenCode</span></a></li><li><a class="harness-logo" data-talivia-event="harness-logo-click" data-talivia-event-label="Antigravity" href="/for/antigravity"><img src="/harness/antigravity.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"/><span>Antigravity</span></a></li><li><a class="harness-logo" data-talivia-event="harness-logo-click" data-talivia-event-label="GitHub Copilot" href="/for/copilot"><img src="/harness/copilot.svg" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"/><span>GitHub Copilot</span></a></li><li><a class="harness-logo" data-talivia-event="harness-logo-click" data-talivia-event-label="Kimi Code" href="/for/kimi"><img src="/harness/kimi.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"/><span>Kimi Code</span></a></li></ul></div></div><div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true"><div class="marquee-track"><span class="mq-chip"><b>$</b>/agenkit</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>conductor</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>backend-architect</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>▸</b>architecture-design</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>test-engineer</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>▸</b>test-driven-development</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>code-reviewer</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>▸</b>requesting-code-review</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>debugger</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>▸</b>systematic-debugging</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>data-engineer</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>frontend-engineer</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>infra-devops-engineer</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>▸</b>finishing-a-development-branch</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>security-engineer</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>perf-observability-engineer</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>▸</b>writing-plans</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>$</b>/agenkit</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>conductor</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>backend-architect</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>▸</b>architecture-design</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>test-engineer</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>▸</b>test-driven-development</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>code-reviewer</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>▸</b>requesting-code-review</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>debugger</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>▸</b>systematic-debugging</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>data-engineer</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>frontend-engineer</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>infra-devops-engineer</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>▸</b>finishing-a-development-branch</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>security-engineer</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>◆</b>perf-observability-engineer</span><span class="mq-chip"><b>▸</b>writing-plans</span></div></div><section class="section container" data-talivia-visible="problem-seen"><div class="split"><div><p class="label">The solo-builder tax</p><h2 class="h2">You&#x27;re doing the job of an entire team, alone.</h2></div><p class="lede">The gap isn&#x27;t effort. It&#x27;s expertise. A generalist writes the code; a specialist knows the production concerns you didn&#x27;t think to ask about.</p></div><div class="expertise" style="margin-top:var(--space-2xl)"><div class="expertise-copy"><h3>What a specialist actually considers</h3><p class="muted" style="margin-top:var(--space-md)">Watch one agent reason through a routine task - the idempotency, reconciliation, indexes, and async calls a solo generalist quietly skips. That gap is what AgenKit closes, automatically.</p></div><div class="mind" aria-label="A specialist reasoning through a routine task"><div class="mind-stack"><div class="mind-panel is-active" aria-hidden="false"><div class="mind-head"><span class="mind-who">Backend Architect</span><span class="mind-task">thinking about: <!-- -->accept Stripe webhooks</span></div><ul class="mind-list"><li class="mind-item "><span class="mind-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Make it idempotent: retries deliver the same event twice; dedupe by event id.</span></li><li class="mind-item "><span class="mind-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Verify the signature before trusting a single byte of the payload.</span></li><li class="mind-item "><span class="mind-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>This is I/O-bound → run it async, with a timeout, retry, and backoff.</span></li><li class="mind-item "><span class="mind-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Store the raw event first, ack fast, process out of band.</span></li><li class="mind-item "><span class="mind-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Reconcile daily against Stripe; webhooks do get dropped.</span></li></ul></div><div class="mind-panel is-ghost" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mind-head"><span class="mind-who">Data Engineer</span><span class="mind-task">thinking about: <!-- -->list a user&#x27;s recent orders</span></div><ul class="mind-list"><li class="mind-item "><span class="mind-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>This query full-scans; add a composite index on (user_id, created_at).</span></li><li class="mind-item "><span class="mind-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Page with a keyset cursor, not OFFSET, or page 900 crawls.</span></li><li class="mind-item "><span class="mind-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>That migration locks the table; run it online and backfill in batches.</span></li><li class="mind-item "><span class="mind-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Don&#x27;t SELECT * across a join you never read; it bloats the plan.</span></li></ul></div><div class="mind-panel is-ghost" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mind-head"><span class="mind-who">Security Engineer</span><span class="mind-task">thinking about: <!-- -->add a file upload</span></div><ul class="mind-list"><li class="mind-item "><span class="mind-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Validate the type by magic bytes, not the filename extension.</span></li><li class="mind-item "><span class="mind-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Store outside the web root; serve via a signed, expiring URL.</span></li><li class="mind-item "><span class="mind-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Cap the size and rate-limit; an unbounded upload is a DoS.</span></li><li class="mind-item "><span class="mind-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Strip metadata and re-encode; uploads smuggle EXIF and payloads.</span></li></ul></div></div><p class="mind-foot">Decisions a generalist skips, applied automatically.</p></div></div></section><div class="hatch" aria-hidden="true"></div><section id="whats-inside" class="section container" data-talivia-visible="kits-seen"><div class="center"><p class="label">The /agenkit workflow</p><h2 class="h2">One command runs the whole engineering lifecycle.</h2><p class="lead" style="margin-top:var(--space-md)">You describe the task once. The Conductor hands each phase to the right specialist and pauses for your approval, the way a senior team ships software.</p></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);transition:opacity 500ms var(--ease-out) 0ms, transform 500ms var(--ease-out) 0ms"><div style="margin-top:var(--space-2xl)"><div class="founding" data-talivia-visible="founding-seen"><div class="founding-main"><p class="label" style="margin:0">Founding price</p><h3 class="founding-head">First <!-- -->150<!-- --> subscribers pay<!-- --> <span class="accent">$<!-- -->3.49<!-- -->/mo</span>.</h3><p class="founding-sub">After the 150 founding seats, AgenKit is $15/mo. Claim one and your renewal never goes up.</p><div class="founding-bar" role="progressbar" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="150" aria-valuenow="5" aria-label="5 of 150 founding seats claimed"><span class="founding-fill" style="width:3%"></span></div><p class="founding-meta"><b>145</b> of <!-- -->150<!-- --> founding seats left</p></div><div class="founding-action"><span class="founding-price">$<!-- -->3.49<small>/mo</small></span><span class="founding-was">then $<!-- -->15<!-- -->/mo</span><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_TvD3KmiP1XyKdrP13r0Q5cX96Qr2Zb09CoTdm3zrQLG" data-talivia-event="buy-subscription-click" data-talivia-event-price="39" data-talivia-event-location="founding-offer">Claim a founding seat<!-- --> <span class="ar">↗</span></a><span class="founding-fine">14-day refund · cancel any time</span></div></div></div></div><div class="center" style="margin-top:var(--space-xl)"><a class="btn btn-dark btn-lg" data-talivia-event="kit-card-click" data-talivia-event-kit="engineering-kit" href="/kits/engineering-kit">See what&#x27;s inside the kit <span class="ar">→</span></a><p class="muted" style="margin-top:var(--space-sm);font-size:var(--text-sm)">The full workflow, every specialist, and exactly how to use it.</p><p style="margin-top:var(--space-md);font-size:var(--text-sm)"><a class="nav-link" data-talivia-event="home-link-click" data-talivia-event-label="agents" href="/agents">Meet the eleven agents →</a> · <a class="nav-link" data-talivia-event="home-link-click" data-talivia-event-label="guides" href="/guides">Workflow guides →</a> · <a class="nav-link" data-talivia-event="home-link-click" data-talivia-event-label="docs" href="/docs">Install docs →</a></p></div></section><div class="hatch" aria-hidden="true"></div><section id="how" class="section container"><div class="center"><p class="label">How it works</p><h2 class="h2">Install, activate, go.</h2><p class="lead">Live in under two minutes, from checkout to a working AI team.</p></div><div class="steps" style="margin-top:var(--space-2xl)"><div class="step"><span class="n">01</span><h3>Get the CLI</h3><p>Nothing to install. The commands below run with <code>npx</code>; Node.js 18+ required.</p><div class="code-card"><div class="code-card-head"><span>optional · install globally</span><button type="button" class="copy-btn" aria-live="polite">copy</button></div><pre class="code"><span class="prompt">$ </span>npm install -g agenkit</pre></div></div><div class="step"><span class="n">02</span><h3>Activate</h3><p>Paste the license key from your receipt. The CLI stores it locally.</p><div class="code-card"><div class="code-card-head"><span>activate</span><button type="button" class="copy-btn" aria-live="polite">copy</button></div><pre class="code"><span class="prompt">$ </span>npx agenkit activate &lt;license-key&gt;</pre></div></div><div class="step"><span class="n">03</span><h3>Install the kit</h3><p>Run it in your project folder. It auto-detects your harness and installs the right files.</p><div class="code-card"><div class="code-card-head"><span>install the kit</span><button type="button" class="copy-btn" aria-live="polite">copy</button></div><pre class="code"><span class="prompt">$ </span>npx agenkit install engineering-kit</pre></div></div></div></section><section class="section container any-stack" data-talivia-visible="stack-seen"><div class="center"><p class="label">Any stack</p><h2 class="h2">Works in any language, any architecture.</h2><p class="lead" style="margin-top:var(--space-md)">Install it into any project, in any language. The agents read your existing code and follow your conventions, from a single service to a modular monolith to microservices.</p></div><div class="stack-marquee" aria-hidden="true"><div class="stack-track"><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/python.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Python</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/typescript.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>TypeScript</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/javascript.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>JavaScript</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/go.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Go</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/rust.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Rust</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/java.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Java</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/ruby.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Ruby</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/php.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>PHP</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/csharp.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>C#</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/cpp.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>C++</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/swift.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Swift</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/kotlin.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Kotlin</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/elixir.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Elixir</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/scala.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Scala</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/python.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Python</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/typescript.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>TypeScript</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/javascript.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>JavaScript</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/go.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Go</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/rust.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Rust</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/java.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Java</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/ruby.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Ruby</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/php.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>PHP</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/csharp.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>C#</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/cpp.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>C++</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/swift.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Swift</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/kotlin.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Kotlin</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/elixir.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Elixir</span><span class="stack-chip"><img src="/stacks/scala.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy"/>Scala</span></div></div></section><section id="harnesses" class="section container" data-talivia-visible="benefits-seen"><p class="label">Why builders keep it installed</p><div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:var(--space-lg)"><div class="card tile"><h3><span class="fi">⌘</span> <!-- -->Seven harnesses, one kit</h3><p>Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, OpenCode, Antigravity, GitHub Copilot, and Kimi Code - the same team everywhere.</p></div><div class="card tile"><h3><span class="fi">↓</span> <!-- -->One command install</h3><p>agenkit install auto-detects your harness and drops files where each tool expects them.</p></div><div class="card tile"><h3><span class="fi">✓</span> <!-- -->Checksum-verified</h3><p>Every artifact is SHA-256 verified before it touches your project. No silent corruption.</p></div><div class="card tile"><h3><span class="fi">⌥</span> <!-- -->Driven by /agenkit</h3><p>One slash command runs the whole pipeline - brainstorm, architecture, plan, test-first build, review, ship.</p></div><div class="card tile"><h3><span class="fi">⟳</span> <!-- -->Update in place</h3><p>agenkit update pulls the latest versions. Your own files are never overwritten.</p></div><div class="card tile"><h3><span class="fi">≈</span> <!-- -->Any stack</h3><p>Agents adapt to your codebase and conventions instead of imposing an architecture.</p></div></div></section><div class="hatch" aria-hidden="true"></div><section class="section container" data-talivia-visible="learn-links-seen"><div class="center"><p class="label">Learn</p><h2 class="h2">Docs, guides, and specialist agents.</h2><p class="lead" style="margin-top:var(--space-md)">Install with the docs, sharpen your workflow with guides, and see who runs each /agenkit phase.</p></div><div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:var(--space-xl)"><a class="card tile" style="text-decoration:none" href="/docs"><h3>Documentation</h3><p>Install, /agenkit workflow, local memory, and the CLI.</p></a><a class="card tile" style="text-decoration:none" href="/guides"><h3>Guides</h3><p>Token limits and workflow playbooks for Claude Code, Cursor, and Codex.</p></a><a class="card tile" style="text-decoration:none" href="/agents"><h3>Agents</h3><p>Eleven specialists: Conductor, architects, test, security, and more.</p></a></div></section><div class="hatch" aria-hidden="true"></div><section id="compare" class="section container"><div class="center"><p class="label">Comparison</p><h2 class="h2">Why builders choose AgenKit.</h2></div><div class="card" style="margin-top:var(--space-xl);padding:0;overflow:hidden"><table class="cmp"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Other kits</th><th>AgenKit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Harness support</td><td class="no">Many kits target one tool</td><td><span class="yes">✓</span>All seven harnesses, one license</td></tr><tr><td>Install</td><td class="no">Manual copy or per-tool scripts</td><td><span class="yes">✓</span>npx agenkit install, auto-detects harness</td></tr><tr><td>What you get</td><td class="no">A small agent pack</td><td><span class="yes">✓</span>Eleven specialists plus /agenkit workflow</td></tr><tr><td>Pricing model</td><td class="no">Often one-time or per-seat SaaS</td><td><span class="yes">✓</span>One yearly subscription, all harnesses</td></tr><tr><td>Checksum-verified installs</td><td class="no">Uncommon</td><td><span class="yes">✓</span>SHA-256 on every download</td></tr><tr><td>Updates over time</td><td class="no">Varies by project</td><td><span class="yes">✓</span>agenkit update while subscribed</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><div class="hatch" aria-hidden="true"></div><section class="section container social-proof" data-talivia-visible="social-proof-seen"><div class="center"><p class="label">Social proof</p><h2 class="h2">Builders are already shipping with AgenKit.</h2><p class="lead" style="margin-top:var(--space-md)">Trusted by professional and senior developers across all seven harnesses.</p></div></section><section id="pricing" class="section container" data-talivia-visible="pricing-seen"><div class="center"><p class="label">Pricing</p><h2 class="h2">One kit. One yearly subscription.</h2><p class="lead">The subscription pays for the updates: the kit keeps evolving, and every new release is included, across all seven harnesses. No seats, no account to manage.</p></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);transition:opacity 500ms var(--ease-out) 0ms, transform 500ms var(--ease-out) 0ms"><div class="price-solo" style="margin-top:var(--space-2xl)"><div class="price-card featured"><h3>AgenKit subscription</h3><span class="big">$<!-- -->3.49<small class="mono" style="font-size:var(--text-base)">/mo</small></span><p class="muted" style="margin-top:calc(-1 * var(--space-xs))">Founding price for early subscribers, then $<!-- -->15<!-- -->/mo.</p><p class="muted">You&#x27;re subscribing to the updates. Install once; the team keeps getting sharper.</p><ul><li>A full AI engineering team of specialists</li><li>The <code>/agenkit</code> brainstorm-to-ship pipeline</li><li>Every update and new release while subscribed</li><li>One invoice a year · cancel any time</li></ul><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_TvD3KmiP1XyKdrP13r0Q5cX96Qr2Zb09CoTdm3zrQLG?utm_source=site&amp;utm_medium=cta&amp;utm_content=home-pricing" data-talivia-event="buy-subscription-click" data-talivia-event-price="39" data-talivia-event-location="home">Subscribe · $<!-- -->3.49<!-- -->/mo <span class="ar">↗</span></a></div></div></div><p style="margin-top:var(--space-xl)"><a class="nav-link" href="/pricing">Full pricing &amp; FAQ →</a></p></section><div class="hatch" aria-hidden="true"></div><section id="faq" class="section container"><div class="faq-split"><div class="faq-head"><p class="label">FAQ</p><h2 class="h2">Questions, answered.</h2><p class="muted" style="margin-top:var(--space-md);font-size:var(--text-sm)">Still curious? Everything installs locally and keeps working offline once installed.</p></div><div class="faq"><details class="q" open=""><summary data-talivia-event="faq-toggle" data-talivia-event-q="Which tools does it work with?"><span class="qn">01</span> <!-- -->Which tools does it work with?<span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="a">All seven: Claude Code, Cursor, Codex CLI, OpenCode, Antigravity CLI, GitHub Copilot, and Kimi Code. The kit is compiled to the exact file layout each tool expects.</div></details><details class="q"><summary data-talivia-event="faq-toggle" data-talivia-event-q="How do I start it in my tool?"><span class="qn">02</span> <!-- -->How do I start it in my tool?<span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="a">Trigger AgenKit with /agenkit in most tools (Claude Code, Cursor, OpenCode, Antigravity, and Kimi Code). In GitHub Copilot it&#x27;s @agenkit, and in Codex you invoke the AgenKit skill by name. The install step prints the exact trigger for your harness.</div></details><details class="q"><summary data-talivia-event="faq-toggle" data-talivia-event-q="What exactly do I get?"><span class="qn">03</span> <!-- -->What exactly do I get?<span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="a">The Engineering Kit - a full team of specialist agents, the process skills that guide them, and the /agenkit command - delivered as versioned archives installed by the agenkit CLI. Your license key is the only credential; there is no account to manage.</div></details><details class="q"><summary data-talivia-event="faq-toggle" data-talivia-event-q="Do I need to create an account?"><span class="qn">04</span> <!-- -->Do I need to create an account?<span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="a">No. Checkout issues a license key via Polar; the CLI stores it locally and the API validates it on install.</div></details><details class="q"><summary data-talivia-event="faq-toggle" data-talivia-event-q="Is it one-time or a subscription?"><span class="qn">05</span> <!-- -->Is it one-time or a subscription?<span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="a">A simple subscription that works out to just $3.49/mo (billed yearly). Early subscribers keep that founding rate while subscribed; after that it&#x27;s $15/mo. It covers every update while active, across all seven harnesses. Cancel any time; the installed kit keeps working locally.</div></details><details class="q"><summary data-talivia-event="faq-toggle" data-talivia-event-q="How do updates work?"><span class="qn">06</span> <!-- -->How do updates work?<span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="a">Run agenkit update. It compares your lockfile to the latest versions and refreshes everything your subscription unlocks.</div></details><details class="q"><summary data-talivia-event="faq-toggle" data-talivia-event-q="Is there a refund policy?"><span class="qn">07</span> <!-- -->Is there a refund policy?<span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="a">Yes - a 14-day money-back window, handled through Polar&#x27;s customer portal.</div></details><details class="q"><summary data-talivia-event="faq-toggle" data-talivia-event-q="Is AgenKit related to OpenAI&#x27;s AgentKit?"><span class="qn">08</span> <!-- -->Is AgenKit related to OpenAI&#x27;s AgentKit?<span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="a">No. AgenKit (agenkit.xyz) is an independent product: a guided engineering team you install into Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, and other harnesses. It is not affiliated with OpenAI AgentKit.</div></details></div></div></section><section class="container"><div class="final"><h2>Stop being the bottleneck. Ship like a team.</h2><p class="lead" style="margin-top:var(--space-md)">A full engineering team in every harness you use, driven by one command:<!-- --> <code>/agenkit</code>.</p><div style="margin-top:var(--space-xl)"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_TvD3KmiP1XyKdrP13r0Q5cX96Qr2Zb09CoTdm3zrQLG?utm_source=site&amp;utm_medium=cta&amp;utm_content=home-final" data-talivia-event="final-cta-click" data-talivia-event-price="39" data-talivia-event-location="final">Subscribe · $<!-- -->3.49<!-- -->/mo <span class="ar">↗</span></a></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="footer"><div class="container footer-grid"><div><a class="brand" aria-label="AgenKit home" href="/"><img src="/logo-192.png" alt="" width="36" 