 CLI, GitHub Copilot, and Kimi Code. The kit is compiled to the exact file layout each tool expects.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I start it in my tool?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Trigger AgenKit with /agenkit in most tools (Claude Code, Cursor, OpenCode, Antigravity, and Kimi Code). In GitHub Copilot it's @agenkit, and in Codex you invoke the AgenKit skill by name. The install step prints the exact trigger for your harness.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What exactly do I get?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The Engineering Kit - a full team of specialist agents, the process skills that guide them, and the /agenkit command - delivered as versioned archives installed by the agenkit CLI. Your license key is the only credential; there is no account to manage.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need to create an account?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Checkout issues a license key via Polar; the CLI stores it locally and the API validates it on install.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is it one-time or a subscription?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A simple subscription that works out to just $3.49/mo (billed yearly). Early subscribers keep that founding rate while subscribed; after that it's $15/mo. It covers every update while active, across all seven harnesses. Cancel any time; the installed kit keeps working locally.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do updates work?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Run agenkit update. It compares your lockfile to the latest versions and refreshes everything your subscription unlocks.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is there a refund policy?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes - a 14-day money-back window, handled through Polar's customer portal.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is AgenKit related to OpenAI's AgentKit?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. AgenKit (agenkit.xyz) is an independent product: a guided engineering team you install into Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, and other harnesses. It is not affiliated with OpenAI AgentKit.\"}}]}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"c:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$13\"}}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"container hero\",\"data-talivia-visible\":\"hero-seen\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"hero-glow\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\"$L14\",\"$L15\"]}],\"$L16\",\"$L17\",\"$L18\",\"$L19\",\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\",\"$L1f\",\"$L20\",\"$L21\",\"$L22\",\"$L23\",\"$L24\",\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"],null,\"$L29\"]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[[\"$\",\"$L2a\",null,{\"children\":\"$L2b\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"name\":\"next-size-adjust\",\"content\":\"\"}]],[\"$\",\"$L2c\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$2d\",null,{\"fallback\":null,\"children\":\"$L2e\"}]}]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"30:I[6837,[\"909\",\"static/chunks/909-8c697c20fd8243aa.js\",\"974\",\"static/chunks/app/page-fcb398b3972dcb96.js\"],\"ExpertiseReveal\"]\n31:I[8398,[\"909\",\"static/chunks/909-8c697c20fd8243aa.js\",\"974\",\"static/chunks/app/page-fcb398b3972dcb96.js\"],\"Reveal\"]\n32:I[4093,[\"909\",\"static/chunks/909-8c697c20fd8243aa.js\",\"974\",\"static/chunks/app/page-fcb398b3972dcb96.js\"],\"FoundingOffer\"]\n33:I[3225,[\"909\",\"static/chunks/909-8c697c20fd8243aa.js\",\"974\",\"static/chunks/app/page-fcb398b3972dcb96.js\"],\"CopyCommand\"]\n38:I[2673,[],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n3a:I[9628,[],\"AsyncMetadataOutlet\"]\nf:[\"$\",\"$L6\",\"claude-code-memory-claude-md-vs-index\",{\"href\":\"/guides/claude-code-memory-claude-md-vs-index\",\"data-talivia-event\":\"footer-link-click\",\"data-talivia-event-label\":\"Claude